    #      P3's committed open-check record; the edit open check over the host
    #      keep, recorded as m2p3-open-<utc-date>-<shortsha>;
    #   5. this script's own standard error counted (specs/0017 P1 verification
    #      ruling 7).
    # No cell value, text, reference or part name is printed.
    #
    # CARRIED TO M2 part 3 P1 from part 2 P2's run script (printed in
